WEBVTT

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Priya Nair>So the plan is final, we migrate to Supabase. Firebase quota is the reason, we cannot pay for Blaze.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:20.000
<v Kabir Shah>Can we keep MongoDB for analytics?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:40.000
<v Priya Nair>No, one database. Everything goes to Postgres.

00:12:41.000 --> 00:13:05.000
<v Arjun Mehta>What is the risk if the migration slips past September?

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:30.000
<v Priya Nair>Then registrations open on Firebase and we hit the quota again on day one. Migration must finish before registrations open on 15 September.

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:40.000
<v Sneha Patil>Action item: Sneha will send the final poster assets to Arjun by Friday.
